body:
Hi guys,

It seems that the [Sass BEM](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/blame/master/src/css/_base.scss#L7-L17) mixin is using the wrong BEM convention for the `element` and `modifier` mixin:

```sass
@mixin element($element) {
  &--#{$element} {
    @content
  }
}

@mixin modifier($modifier) {
  &__#{$modifier} {
    @content
  }
}
```

According to [BEM](http://getbem.com/naming/) it should rather be:

```sass
@mixin element($element) {
  &__#{$element} {
    @content
  }
}

@mixin modifier($modifier) {
  &--#{$modifier} {
    @content
  }
}
```
